<title>BRAZIL: Brazil banks BBA, BCN deny takeover talks.</title>
<headline>Brazil banks BBA, BCN deny takeover talks.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian bank BBA Creditanstalt denied Tuesday a press report saying it was about to acquire control of private bank BCN.</p>
<p>&quot;There is no truth in the report,&quot; said a BBA spokeswoman.</p>
<p>A BCN spokesman also denied the report by Jornal do Brasil daily.</p>
<p>BCN has recently merged with Banco Itamarati.</p>
<p>-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom, 55-11-2324411</p>
</text>
